# Layout tp5-1017-35 (2026-10-19; indexer in INT8 since 2026-10-20): DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017-EXL3-3.5bpw in tensor parallel over the five cards
# (native backend), the draft head layer-split on the RTX PRO 6000, 1048576-token cache; engine 309ef6d1 (dev f157fc0b + #449 + #468 + #472
# + #532 + the indexer precision commit, fork branch dsv41f-1017).
# EXL3_DSA_INDEXER_DTYPE: precision of the lightning indexer's prefill scoring per GPU architecture, here int8 on every card (values fp16, int8,
# fp8, fp4; one value or ARCH:DTYPE items such as sm_80:int8,sm_120:fp4; unset = fp16). FP16 on engine 5c0da061: layouts/tp5-1017-35-fp16.env
CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0,1,3,4,2
TABBY_EXL3_GENERATOR_CHUNK=16384
EXLLAMAV3_TUNE_CACHE=/home/ai/serve/autotune-1017
EXLLAMA_NO_P2P_COPY=1
EXL3_DSA_INDEXER_DTYPE=sm_80:int8,sm_120:int8
# EXL3_INT8_GEMV=0 (since 2026-10-20 11:10): FP16 activations in the weight GEMVs; the INT8-activation path is slower here
# (C-coding decode 98.7 -> 102.2 tok/s, higher draft acceptance)
EXL3_INT8_GEMV=0
PYTHONPATH=/home/ai/rnd/release/all/src-309ef6d11920:/home/ai/rnd/release/all/native-309ef6d11920:/home/ai/rnd/tabby-fresh
DS41_CONFIG=/home/ai/serve/ds41-exl3-tp5-1017-35.yml
